   243	def main(grid: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray:
   244	    """Move the left-wall objects to the right by a row-wise shear, rank them by post-shear safe area against blocker halos, then restack them above the ground.
   245	
   246	    Input structure:
   247	    - A black background contains a full grey ground row on the bottom, 3-4 distinct monochrome 4-connected objects attached to the left wall, and 2-3 orange singleton blockers in the right half.
   248	    - Each object occupies 2-3 rows, 1-3 columns, and 4-6 pixels total; the blockers are isolated from each other and from the ground.
   249	
